# The repetition curve (scoring.repeat, THPS 2): the same trick again in one combo is worth less each
# time, 100%, 75%, 50%, 25%, then the 10% floor. Up the vert ramp at 15.5 m/s, six kickflips in one
# 2.5 s air: 100 + 75 + 50 + 25 + 10 + 10 = 270, x6 = 1,620 (each entry's value in the event).
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 15.5
tap flip+left 132
tap flip+left 179
tap flip+left 226
tap flip+left 273
tap flip+left 320
tap flip+left 367
run 600
expect event trickEnd{trick=Kickflip} count == 6
expect event land{quality=clean} within 424..428
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + Kickflip + Kickflip + Kickflip + Kickflip + Kickflip,points=1620,multiplier=6} within 436..440
expect no event bail
